<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> a prov:SoftwareAgent;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "delphisci dataset-resolvability assessor (Grok 4.7)";
    prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/usesModel> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LanguageModel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7";
    dc:identifier "grok-4.7-high-fast".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2018-hcn2-14--grok> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7 on levin-2018-hcn2-14: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.36";
    dc:description "Learning rate in a named assay, with a reported n of 20 in the rescued group, is an explicit proportion. No behavioral repository contains these trials, and the paper's data statement does not add one. Pre-selection and motor confounds would have to be checked on the trial logs, which are unavailable. The proportions cannot be resolved from open data.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: In the automated red-light avoidance assay, score the fraction of morphologically normal tadpoles that meet the learning criterion in controls, nicotine-only, and nicotine plus Hcn2-WT. The claim is confirmed by roughly 100%, 12%, and 85%; a nicotine-plus-HCN2 rate near the nicotine-only rate would refute restoration of learning.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Motor or visual impairment can look like a failure to learn.", "The tested animals were pre-selected as morphologically normal.", "Trial-level trajectories from the automated assay are not public.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.73"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.365"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasVerdict> "needs-new-data".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2018-hcn2-14--grok--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis feasibility of levin-2018-hcn2-14 by Grok 4.7: 0.18";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-analysis-feasibility>;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
